{"schemaVersion":"galpedia-static-detail-model-v1","dataRevision":"a0c0367b8270b080feef0ef1fe65522144dc62343feb9d752729d92867d0d639","workId":"33016","model":{"presentationWorkId":"egs:33016","staff":{"artwork":[],"scenario":[],"music":[],"other":[]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_bangumi_106137","characterName":"諾亞","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"106137","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"368785"}]},"originalCharacterName":"諾亞","characterNameSource":null,"role":"主角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"18"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"诺亚是一名 18 岁的科维斯士兵，他也使用鲜红色的武器。他虽然体格纤细，但体能却相当好。拿着武器的样子看起来像武士一般帅气。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"作为科维斯的“送行者”，诺亚会为战场上失去生命的士兵凭吊。因为在战场上接触过许多同伴之死的经历，他对这个只能为了生存而夺取对方性命的世界带着疑问而战斗。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"106137"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/10/10e82d61b853aa24cbbf1c06c681c4b6b923128691167e1a341b96f707a6c2de.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/55/5573ab1f6ef22f5eeae4aeb5c6d3988e1da02b38caf3cadcdaee2ff060408822.webp","width":179,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_106138","characterName":"澪","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"106138","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"368785"}]},"originalCharacterName":"澪","characterNameSource":null,"role":"主角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"19"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"弥央是自如使用双环武器的安格努斯士兵。速度一流，擅长躲避攻击！年龄为19岁，有着形状十分独特的耳朵。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"弥央是安格努斯的“送行者”，有着严谨却温柔的性格，因而受到伙伴的欢迎，但似乎总是一个人背负烦恼。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"106138"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/79/79142e9e554b29d73b3fbb4d7ab3fb7008dd70f700ef13620f7076ab5c742026.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/45/45048629a4b9736b0514e4d95d3c0efc0629aae3ccea31f48d57fd5eb3135a2f.webp","width":192,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"津田美波","creatorId":"egs:creator:25740","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:25740","canonicalEntityId":"egs:creator:25740","name":"津田美波","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:368785:106138:5736:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_106139","characterName":"蘭茲","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"106139","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"368785"}]},"originalCharacterName":"蘭茲","characterNameSource":null,"role":"主角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"18"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"18 岁，和诺亚同为科维斯的士兵，体格高大且灵活，武器是可以变为盾的大剑。为了同伴而战，是一个可以依靠的战友。和诺亚从小一起长大，愿意拼尽一切去守护同伴。但也因此会做出一些让自己陷入危险的鲁莽行为。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"106139"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c5/c5464cc0956c37c6ef756030b8c72170d434e276c26b52744aea4882155d87eb.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a4/a47d922208fff6654978f02dbee85ee3b1f58d6fefaa778ca924557f541d722e.webp","width":192,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"田邊幸輔","creatorId":"vndb:s19119","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s19119","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s19119","name":"田邊幸輔","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:368785:106139:41113:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_106140","characterName":"優妮","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"106140","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"368785"}]},"originalCharacterName":"優妮","characterNameSource":null,"role":"主角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"18"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"18 岁，使用手杖形状的枪。和诺亚、兰兹一同长大，擅长战斗回复，头上的翅膀好像在哪里见过"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"心直口快的性格，有一些毒舌。很尊敬诺亚，和兰兹是无话不谈的朋友，对于同伴很有责任感。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"106140"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c9/c9348fda273ff26fd63b53a21cc39bff7ecf9d669fde2d2c369f3963376286b8.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7a/7a8016bf987310c737a8fb8168f152eff0df4541e47a28046b6574f565875e6d.webp","width":256,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"潘めぐみ","creatorId":"vndb:s8184","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s8184","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s8184","name":"潘 めぐみ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:368785:106140:7050:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_106141","characterName":"泰恩","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"106141","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"368785"}]},"originalCharacterName":"泰恩","characterNameSource":null,"role":"主角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"18"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"18 岁，是来自安格努斯的士兵，操纵一种像【カタシロ】的纸片作为武器，还为它取了个可爱名字叫【蒙德】。有着标志性的黑色眼睛和橙色围巾。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"会与弥央和圣奈一起行动，因自身超高的洞察力和精妙的战术而备受信赖。但也有令人担心的地方，如有时会过于慎重，以及着急起来就会有些鲁莽。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"106141"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3c/3c95cb74c41b59951c0b86f4ccea935161a93935de5edb0d1f7d9cabd3f29bb2.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b2/b23f660e1657b82b1520bede6466e797cfa5307363d521d81aeec75e0b8a964d.webp","width":198,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"木村良平","creatorId":"vndb:s382","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s382","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s382","name":"木村 良平","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:368785:106141:4994:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_106142","characterName":"聖奈","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"106142","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"368785"}]},"originalCharacterName":"聖奈","characterNameSource":null,"role":"主角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"18"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"18 岁，使用的武器为巨大的锤子，是弥央的队友，虽然体格娇小却有着超出想象的怪力。头发有一部分发出蓝色的光芒。从前就和弥央一起生活，对年长一岁的弥央十分仰慕。喜欢锻炼肌肉，对自己的力量感到自豪，开朗元气的性格。私下也有不够自信的一面。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"106142"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/15/15e3097a8090aee6ea026968a272616738f66f62c07fb7e83a854349f910a770.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/38/3822c126550cd0d214869bc168ee6fa766d941ea906910509a36d588318971bc.webp","width":256,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"佐藤美由希","creatorId":"vndb:s2153","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s2153","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s2153","name":"佐藤 美由希","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:368785:106142:19563:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_109784","characterName":"艾賽爾","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"109784","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"368785"}]},"originalCharacterName":"艾賽爾","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"科維斯「4號殖民地」的軍務長。同時使用兩把細長的劍。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"109784"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ab/ab4273994bf4c01b74776c81181472fb2d3b57a1fd9ce97ad61af0a169120cf6.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/60/603c14ef39728a54a9b5adba4447265a91013450d9da0da791773f70f9c507c1.webp","width":192,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"種﨑敦美","creatorId":"vndb:s196","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s196","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s196","name":"種﨑 敦美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:368785:109784:7575:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_109785","characterName":"石動","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"109785","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"368785"}]},"originalCharacterName":"石動","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"隶属于安格努斯【拉姆达殖民地】，担任军务长一职。性格直爽，对下属有着极大的信任。但似乎对过去的某件事放不下，而感到内疚。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"泰恩曾是石动的部下，并对同是战略家的泰恩十分赏识，进而教授他许多战术。但现在，不知为何，他们居然在相互攻击...？"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"109785"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ad/ade77b4752d7702ce36ad6f44a7c3634452bb9a74eda997a969cceb77ccf0993.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4f/4fbb1536b1d0e097efc5d11551d960cd4b4ec5227da9835f191f2aaf6c9a6d5c.webp","width":192,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"前野智昭","creatorId":"vndb:s64","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s64","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s64","name":"前野 智昭","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:368785:109785:5121:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_109786","characterName":"カムナビ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"109786","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"368785"}]},"originalCharacterName":"カムナビ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"年龄：不明"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"具体设定：安格努斯【德尔塔殖民地】的军务长。使用一把如火焰般的长枪作为武器。是一位实打实的勇将，热爱酣畅淋漓的战斗。面对【科维斯】阵营时，虽互为敌人，但也会对他们表示敬意。战斗中，如同一团炽热的火焰，一骑当千，故有【红莲的神南火】称号。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"109786"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1d/1defef8c801fac0a6ce66edcbe0cc2dfe90bb41b497725580eabe9ca7f35ad6d.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/98/989f909a524b25948f7f0ded9c8150f3a404a984e8a2e319deccc1a7bb0dbb7f.webp","width":192,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"楠大典","creatorId":"vndb:s681","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s681","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s681","name":"楠 大典","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:368785:109786:4985:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_109787","characterName":"ゲルニカ・ヴァンダム","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"109787","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"368785"}]},"originalCharacterName":"ゲルニカ・ヴァンダム","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"诺亚等六人在战场上战斗时，出现在他们面前的神秘男子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"诺亚等人在范达姆所给的建议下，为了寻找「真正的敌人」，以「大剑耸立的大地」为目标展开共同行动。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"109787"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1a/1a3d9a7ad0513172e33b474d7fd31ce13dcbcdc0e8766f540186cf2a5feaa2b5.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/df/df72ed97860e6bee44bfb26343d074c65fb656a5ffd285470bca074e15338a7a.webp","width":192,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"玄田哲章","creatorId":"vndb:s9444","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s9444","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s9444","name":"横居 光雄","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:368785:109787:3855:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_109788","characterName":"リク","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"109788","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"368785"}]},"originalCharacterName":"リク","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"和诺亚一样是科维斯人，粗眉毛是他的特色，手艺人，担任铁巨神的修理人员。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"里克具有泰山崩于前而色不变的气质，性格豁达，总能给诺亚他们提出合适的建议。武器的整备完全可以交给里克！"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"里克和玛娜娜两人一组加入队伍，擅长攻击敌人的弱点，战斗方法灵活多变，靠弱化敌人来左右战局！两个人一起战斗的英姿真不愧是诺彭组合！"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"109788"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1a/1a4823bd41311c1add0cd3123818be41d18555eceb17c9a42f9cf316bf4b19d3.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1f/1f9f5d54f9eb99c0ac4c8bc3f350419b03cdcae7822a31b4cc9aef828e7d0e16.webp","width":192,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"千本木彩花","creatorId":"vndb:s12945","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s12945","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s12945","name":"千本木 彩花","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:368785:109788:10838:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_109789","characterName":"マナナ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"109789","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"368785"}]},"originalCharacterName":"マナナ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"安格努斯人，戴着一顶厨师帽，非常擅长料理。和弥央一起行动时负责烹饪。以前在殖民地担任过料理长"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"玛娜娜总是在想食物相关的事情，在冒险中，把可以烹饪的物品交给她的话，她就会端上美食哦！玛娜娜性格开朗，有她一起的旅途会很有趣！"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"里克和玛娜娜两人一组加入队伍，擅长攻击敌人的弱点，战斗方法灵活多变，靠弱化敌人来左右战局！两个人一起战斗的英姿真不愧是诺彭组合！"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"109789"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b4/b46075ba9e543fa3b816a7ba96c9a4e42ce7b1ed28656f183a02c33fbd70d743.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/35/352460e311e6092d3d28af03cb3258d617a86f91818e3468acadc0775313950e.webp","width":192,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"洲崎綾","creatorId":"vndb:s3893","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s3893","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s3893","name":"洲崎 綾","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:368785:109789:8403:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_112949","characterName":"ユズリハ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"112949","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"368785"}]},"originalCharacterName":"ユズリハ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"让叶是一位能使用弓箭从敌人盲区展开攻击的「幻弓士（攻击者）」，能够消除自身的气息，安全地狩猎敌人"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"让叶虽然隶属安格努斯，但平日都在森林中低调生活。也许是因为生活在森林中的关系，身手非常敏捷，可以在树上和细绳上游走，本人也很受殖民地同伴的信任。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"112949"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/58/58017273e36c5613b0dee1a5a81f99be11b5b6a0d849fcbba13dc53c2eb0083e.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7c/7c256d5a120b2696018b6fc8531a579352cd8c012ab1cb41d98cbfb3a1e041ac.webp","width":192,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"釘宮理恵","creatorId":"vndb:s500","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s500","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s500","name":"釘宮理恵","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:368785:112949:3936:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_112950","characterName":"ゼオン","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"112950","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"368785"}]},"originalCharacterName":"ゼオン","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"职业是“守护者指挥官（防卫者）”，手持剑和盾一边守护着同伴一边战斗。他隶属于科维斯，和诺亚等人好像在很久以前就认识。因为在逆境中会提高能力，所以能够面对强大的敌人，是值得信赖的同伴。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"泽恩所属的科维斯因为粮食不足而面临严峻的危机，他在想着同伴们生活的同时每天努力奋斗着。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"112950"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3a/3a9b4482d25db6960f4401fbf0f4c75b761f0119d0c08d59c615c1c389bb0919.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3f/3f5fef42aa4d462e9d606e8e4f33fe3b5d02fe5c779981231a87688387a52be5.webp","width":192,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"逢坂良太","creatorId":"vndb:s248","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s248","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s248","name":"逢坂 良太","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:368785:112950:7385:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_112951","characterName":"ルディ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"112951","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"368785"}]},"originalCharacterName":"ルディ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"与诺亚一起并肩战斗的战士，职业属于【治疗者】。是一位擅长支援的伙伴，并且拥有一个能使所有友军恢复的技能，十分值得信赖。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"隶属于【科维斯】殖民地，担任开发和修复武器的机械师。他总是能开发出派上大用场的武器，源自于他对机器的强烈热爱，并且他还为每种武器都取了名字。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"112951"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/10/10c08585b554c2361d28cd4b94d4e454faeb5e7a4925e8f602ba8e3bbb1dab55.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/df/dfc069b33daa3483faabca62a90b68e0f7921d01e7387495f14e8d6a7e958ca4.webp","width":192,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"小林ゆう","creatorId":"vndb:s246","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s246","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s246","name":"小林 ゆう","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:368785:112951:4398:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_112952","characterName":"ニイナ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"112952","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"368785"}]},"originalCharacterName":"ニイナ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"身为“攻击者”职业的她，精通剑术，攻击力会随着每次重击而提高，愈战愈强。隶属于安格努斯，但因其出色的剑术和对战局的敏锐判断，在科维斯也是人尽皆知。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"112952"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fd/fd747d619e705568a454131c79f91dee14a76cfd9c3f9d663f996167bdf31f65.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d3/d359b738c0eedfa3f953070b459090ddbd3f425b741a4b4cdbfe1ce7e3ca0112.webp","width":192,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"小清水亜美","creatorId":"vndb:s622","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s622","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s622","name":"小清水 亜美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:368785:112952:4474:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_112953","characterName":"マシロ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"112953","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"368785"}]},"originalCharacterName":"マシロ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"职业是「星輝士」，给予团队各种增强效果，使用带着很大旗帜的枪形武器。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"性格温文尔雅，被同一殖民地的伙伴亲昵地称为\"小白\"，很会为伙伴着想，作为一名士兵有点过于温柔了。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"112953"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7c/7c9b4777cb8d7a222a397bb7073a3a77c17fc26c53e473d20e7753e112425b8e.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c5/c54421c2b85c96de080088c52e3e7a3d6e044d0cb567afe8ad68801f3ed6319b.webp","width":192,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"悠木碧","creatorId":"vndb:s1321","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1321","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1321","name":"悠木 碧","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:368785:112953:5076:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_113394","characterName":"グレイ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"113394","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"368785"}]},"originalCharacterName":"グレイ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"战斗类别是【攻击者】，右眼戴着眼罩，使用双枪和襟翼进行大范围攻击。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"格雷是一位拥有工匠气质的英雄，攻击敌人时命中次数越多，攻击就越精炼。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"113394"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/2c/2c5828bdf8d3578d9aaee84401e9b1388068f90779b327788b39f291f4f51a4d.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/30/30f19ce3dda55c7e0ebb952854bd13bca33e23486c785b36e0e7541e81582c1e.webp","width":192,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"千葉繁","creatorId":"vndb:s19868","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s19868","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s19868","name":"千葉繁","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:368785:113394:4110:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_113689","characterName":"アシェラ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"113689","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"368785"}]},"originalCharacterName":"アシェラ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"亚谢菈使用两头都有刀刃的剑进行战斗，也是超攻击型的「防御者」。挥舞武器能够释放强力的斩击，通过攻击能够吸引敌人的仇恨，即使周围的队友受到攻击也可以反击。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"亚谢菈隶属于科维斯，作为一个喜欢去战场和敌方殖民地的战斗爱好者，是科维斯知名的战斗狂。 似乎因为不惧怕死亡的危险，也不在乎好友死活的冷淡性格而被大家害怕着。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"113689"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/47/47c15aa8b3eaeecac56f1c9ce30d96e65435da6166f8bf877d2b672974cd9cb4.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/17/1735d7046870f1ad73a9e8b06edd67774652b5f2fbbf7387f787834a4d374a01.webp","width":192,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"M・A・O","creatorId":"vndb:s7526","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s7526","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s7526","name":"市道 真央","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:368785:113689:10887:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_115320","characterName":"N","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"115320","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"368785"}]},"originalCharacterName":"N","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"谜团重重的执政官。和其他执政官的打扮好像有点不一样。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"115320"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0a/0aa6bdbcdd5111b4b73be99a1520c4c0f65e919bbd5a091c661ae7dbc4cc527e.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/44/448dfc92d2cf2ea553716f01098b7279368d4ca639ab679a08e8a7ba2ee5b003.webp","width":192,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_123693","characterName":"ミヤビ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"123693","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"368785"}]},"originalCharacterName":"ミヤビ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-